  "narration": {
    "en": {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "v-1",
          "text": "The budget arithmetic itself checks out: stopping MBG frees up to Rp88.15T a year.",
          "els": [
            "p-claim",
            "n1",
            "n2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-2",
          "text": "The step the headline needs, how an unspent budget line becomes a rescued economy, is never stated.",
          "els": [
            "e1",
            "n3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-3",
          "text": "And four documented stakeholder groups are priced at zero on the way there.",
          "els": [
            "h0",
            "h1",
            "h2",
            "h3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-4",
          "text": "Placed against the whole 2026 spending line, the lever shrinks.",
          "els": [
            "p-scale",
            "sg0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-5",
          "text": "Debt interest alone is nearly seven times larger.",
          "els": [
            "sg2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-6",
          "text": "These are documented existing flows: contracts, wages and meals on record, not projections.",
          "els": [
            "p-flow",
            "m1",
            "m2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-7",
          "text": "The stop toggle shows what an abrupt halt severs. Struck rows are flows that break.",
          "els": [
            "m3",
            "m4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-8",
          "text": "Losses land on specific groups within weeks, and any fiscal benefit is diffuse and delayed.",
          "els": [
            "p-inc",
            "i0",
            "i1",
            "i2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-9",
          "text": "The options panel lists the positions named actors occupy, without ranking them.",
          "els": [
            "p-options",
            "o-1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-10",
          "text": "The family panel lists the outlets that carried the same skeleton.",
          "els": [
            "p-family"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "id": {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "v-1",
          "text": "Aritmetika anggarannya sendiri konsisten: menyetop MBG membebaskan hingga Rp88,15 T per tahun.",
          "els": [
            "p-claim",
            "n1",
            "n2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-2",
          "text": "Langkah yang dibutuhkan judul, bagaimana pos anggaran yang tidak terpakai menjadi ekonomi yang terselamatkan, tidak pernah dinyatakan.",
          "els": [
            "e1",
            "n3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-3",
          "text": "Dan empat kelompok pemangku kepentingan yang terdokumentasi dihargai nol dalam perjalanan ke sana.",
